# Class: obo:CHEBI_192501 (sanguiin H6)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CHEBI_192501 "Dimer of casuarictin linked by a bond between the gallic acid residue and one of the hexahydroxydiphenic acid units. It has sanguisorbic acid ester groups as linking units between glucopyranose moieties.")
