# Class: obo:CHEBI_192502 (lambertianin C )

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CHEBI_192502 "Is trimer of casuarictin linked by sanguisorbic acid ester groups between glucopyranose moieties. It contributes to the antioxidant capacity of raspberries.")
