# Class: obo:CHEBI_27300 (vitamin D)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CHEBI_27300 "Any member of a group of fat-soluble hydroxy seco-steroids that exhibit biological activity against vitamin D deficiency. Vitamin D  can be obtained from sun exposure, food and supplements and is biologically inactive and converted into the biologically active calcitriol via double hydroxylation in the body.")
