# Class: obo:CHEBI_28057 (amylopectin)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CHEBI_28057 "A polydisperse highly branched polysaccharide derivative composed of chains of D-glucopyranose residues in alpha(1->4) glycosidic linkage. The chains are joined together by alpha(1->6) glycosidic linkages. A small number of alpha(1->3) glycosidic linkages and some 6-phosphate ester groups also may occur. The branches in amylopectin typically contain 24 to 30 glucose residues.")
